  id: tutorial.speed_control
  title: Speed Control
  description: 'Speed control is a toolkit: W, skating, and tuck build speed; S,
    wedge, and quick stop bleed it away.'
  autoAccept: 0
  tutorialQuest: 1
  stages:
  - id: tutorial.speed_control.stage1
    title: Use the Fastest Option for the Moment
    description: On steeper terrain, tuck is the cleanest way to hold speed without
      extra ski movement.
    objectives:
    - id: tutorial.speed_control.tuck
      title: Tuck to carry speed
      description: Press Left Shift while moving to reduce drag and hold your speed
        longer.
